		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  écriture d'un large object]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=26014#p26014"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>C&#039;est explicité dans la doc. Deuxième paragraphe du chapitre <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/9.6/static/lo-interfaces.html" rel="nofollow">https://www.postgresql.org/docs/9.6/sta … faces.html</a> : &quot;All large object manipulation using these functions must take place within an SQL transaction block, since large object file descriptors are only valid for the duration of a transaction.&quot;</p>]]></content>
